  "steps": [
    "<strong>Marinate Tempeh:</strong> Mix balsamic vinegar, soy sauce, maple syrup, garlic powder, salt, and pepper in a shallow dish. Add tempeh and marinate 20–30 min.",
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C). Bake marinated tempeh on a lined tray for 20 min, spooning any remaining marinade over once baked.",
    "<strong>Bake Tofu:</strong> Toss tofu with soy sauce, garlic powder, salt, and pepper. Bake on a lined tray at 400°F for 20–30 min until browned. Can bake alongside tempeh.",
    "<strong>Steam Broccoli:</strong> Bring water to a boil, steam broccoli for ~4 min until bright green and just tender. Remove and cool slightly.",
    "<strong>Assemble Salad:</strong> Divide greens between 4 bowls. Top with broccoli, cucumber, chickpeas, avocado, tempeh, tofu, and hemp seeds.",
    "Drizzle with tahini or dressing of choice, finish with lemon juice, season to taste, and serve."
  ],
  "tips": [
    "For meal prep, keep greens, avocado, and dressing separate until serving.",
    "Swap chickpeas for edamame or lentils if preferred.",
    "Great with maple dijon, lemon tahini, or ginger peanut dressing."
  ],
